From 86370d78423114b56bafce24f4e68e2ecb126e99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pjgowtham <pjgowtham@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 29 Dec 2024 22:55:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] hal: Add LVACFS microphone feature

This feature is only used by newer oplus and nothing devices and is
necessary for the microphone output to not be awfully low in all
situations except calls.

Change-Id: I3ae4e8b3a99765fcb052a07d1dd3082b035d62ad
---

